OL,3,CCCTV reveals moment homeless man sets
OL,4,Cfire to ex-friend's boat docked on
OL,5,Ccanal
OL,7,FA homeless man has been jailed for
OL,8,Fmore than seven years after torching
OL,9,Fhis former friend's boat which was
OL,10,Fdocked on Oxford Canal.
OL,12,FCCTV shown to the Oxford Crown Court
OL,13,Fshows Tim Fish arriving at Duke's Cut
OL,14,FLock in Gosford with a green jerry can.
OL,16,FHe then set fire to the boat belonging
OL,17,Fto his ex-friend Max Lamb - who was
OL,18,Finside the boat at the time.
OL,20,FThe prosecution told the court the
OL,21,Fpair fell out two years earlier.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
