OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785403115
OL,3,CCCTV reveals moment homeless man sets
OL,4,Cfire to ex-friend's boat docked on
OL,5,Ccanal
OL,7,FIn a statement read out in court, Mr
OL,8,FLamb said: "Since the fire I have felt
OL,9,Fexposed on the boat and hyper-aware.
OL,11,F"I will probably sell my mooring when
OL,12,FMr Fish is released.
OL,14,F"I now have little trust in people.
OL,15,FThe damage will run into thousands of
OL,16,Fpounds.
OL,18,F"Money I don't have."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
