OL,3,CCCTV reveals moment homeless man sets
OL,4,Cfire to ex-friend's boat docked on
OL,5,Ccanal
OL,7,FFish, was handed an extended sentence
OL,8,Fof seven years and three months on
OL,9,FFriday, July 24.
OL,11,FHe was also given a restraining order
OL,12,Ffor 10 years to not contact the victim
OL,13,For go to Duke's Cut.
